{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_title", "source_sha256": "0f8cbf94893d85b46192a3bfd26a4dc3446253beb4bc47f8ae472bcb10c38e54", "ja": "のり子とおでかけ1", "zh": "和法子出游1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f51ef8ad1c6abf5fba7030a399d83f411743dae5cb3fd43c7d2c0ce88816313a", "ja": "のり子とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和法子一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5a1764c5a248db946ffcf5117712da550c311d53ab73f892096331597a52ecae", "ja": "（のり子と仕事の打ち合わせを兼ねて、喫茶店に来た。\nまだ朝早いせいか、少し眠いな……）", "zh": "（我来到了咖啡店，顺便和诺莉子商量工作。可能是因为时间还很早，稍微有点困啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6f68a7a798b8bca49bfe1a2de14d6f368c16c8a4092600f4f7f3983c1dc8f8c5", "ja": "のり子、朝早くからすまないな。\n今日は8時にラジオ局入りして、その次は……。", "zh": "纪子，一大早就麻烦你了。  \n今天要在8点到广播电台，然后接下来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1002_tenin", "source_sha256": "390792597a46ecdacab97318cac019d2c010b99d10d5580a5d70022e4c442059", "ja": "お待たせしました、コーヒーとモーニングです！", "zh": "让您久等了，这是您的咖啡和早餐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "93ab63983e75d5f00e7ed0329395677098f172456acd0f163c5fad4fd7d4cf55", "ja": "ありがとうございます。……えっ！？\nモーニング、頼んでないような……。", "zh": "谢谢。……咦！？\n我好像没点早餐套餐吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "dc22badc6695b0f9e895a0a93b319fa97df09bc9459bcdb42944c2c4a27e6abe", "ja": "ははーん。{$P$}、名古屋の喫茶店\n文化を知らないね？　これが名古屋のモーニングだよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿——{$P$}，你不了解名古屋的咖啡店文化吧？这就是名古屋的早餐套餐哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "77ea4d6774fb02d595756e2bcf8b2ab590143d00c4ee33a171078daa37503a8d", "ja": "えっ……名古屋では、これが普通なのか？　コーヒー\n一杯で、こんな立派な朝食がついてくるなんて……。", "zh": "咦……在名古屋，这很平常吗？只点一杯咖啡，居然还会附送这么丰盛的早餐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "0638b27059b30fab4d77783a66003fcb712c13d480d7b98e49d5fd143a07fc8d", "ja": "ね！　ね！　すごいよね！　アタシも、名古屋来たら\n絶対これが体験したくてさ！　いやー、感激っ！", "zh": "对吧！对吧！很厉害吧！我来名古屋之前，就特别想亲身体验这个！哎呀，真是太感动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "43459eaad180083569da8729dfa54c0fdb77bfbc90b6fcbd15d3ee53af5939ab", "ja": "うん、これは感激するな。名古屋の人って、\nサービス精神旺盛なんだな。いい街だ。", "zh": "嗯，这确实让人感动。名古屋的人，\n服务精神真是旺盛啊。真是座好城市。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "79a49251530191aa3c5d20b2f3b4ea3748fc8856fa7e544f98c949abcd0f20ee", "ja": "だよねー。アタシも、名古屋に住みたくなっちゃった！\n移住しよっかな！　なーんて♪", "zh": "就是嘛——我也突然想住在名古屋了！要不要搬过去呢！开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3cb0ebdd674026c96bd939685648e6f18d88d1c9b7bb19c84b468005efa02364", "ja": "なるほど、劇場の名古屋支店……\nというのは冗談だけど。", "zh": "原来如此，剧场的名古屋分部……\n当然是开玩笑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3475fe2e879f528e9925450332bd22c6fcdca06ef14e68e785a349f8dd14e63b", "ja": "それくらい頑張って、765プロを盛り上げような。\nのり子、まずは今日のラジオ、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "就努力到这个程度，让765事务所热闹起来吧。\n则子，今天的广播先拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_043nor01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_043nor01_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "6aae43794d9b35a112a1f7291fed303c1283636fe258c1b620e4ec7089c5beb1", "ja": "へへっ、了ー解っ！　日本中に劇場ができるくらい\n頑張ろうね、{$P$}♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，明白啦！一起努力吧，争取让日本各地都建起剧场，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
